    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melilot was bringing fresh veggies to her grandpa like usual that day, when the sky suddenly got ripped open by a huge hand! As it started spewing forth hordes of creepy abominations, she happened upon a magic star gun that seemed to work wonders against them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to her to save bunny land now!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast interconnected lands of bunnies and their neighbours, deep down the earth and up in the clouds. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet many cute friends and many horrifying foes in scenes full of silly humor. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your weapon to propel yourself and navigate through platforming challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new skills to power your gun and blast through your foes with style and glitters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679240/extras/1dc76bbb618b55284c983b86e24529be.poster.avif?t=1750416254\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679240/extras/1dc76bbb618b55284c983b86e24529be.webm?t=1750416254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679240/extras/1dc76bbb618b55284c983b86e24529be.mp4?t=1750416254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No bunnies were harmed in the making of this game. They might get a little scared by all the eldritch stuff going on but they're all gonna be fine. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melilot was bringing fresh veggies to her grandpa like usual that day, when the sky suddenly got ripped open by a huge hand! As it started spewing forth hordes of creepy abominations, she happened upon a magic star gun that seemed to work wonders against them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to her to save bunny land now!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast interconnected lands of bunnies and their neighbours, deep down the earth and up in the clouds. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet many cute friends and many horrifying foes in scenes full of silly humor. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your weapon to propel yourself and navigate through platforming challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new skills to power your gun and blast through your foes with style and glitters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679240/extras/1dc76bbb618b55284c983b86e24529be.poster.avif?t=1750416254\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679240/extras/1dc76bbb618b55284c983b86e24529be.webm?t=1750416254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679240/extras/1dc76bbb618b55284c983b86e24529be.mp4?t=1750416254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No bunnies were harmed in the making of this game. They might get a little scared by all the eldritch stuff going on but they're all gonna be fine. </p></li></ul>",
